  "description": "The meme uses absurd humor by juxtaposing a serious, cinematic moment (Obi-Wan sensing the Force) with a ridiculous, nonsensical metaphor ('as if a million snowflakes all melted at once'). This comedic technique relies on the audience understanding the contrast between high-stakes dramatic tropes and low-stakes, trivial explanations, which is a common trope in internet humor and satire.",
